// Self-hosted verification probe for `compiler/docgen/mod.ax` and `compiler/driver/doc_cmd/mod.ax` (T817 / E19.5).
// Exercises AXS-DOC-001..005, AXS-DOC-010..012, AXS-DOC-050..053, REQ-TOOL-002, REQ-TOOL-187, REQ-TOOL-298.
module main

